        "misc-beat-title": "[SINGLE] Shadows",
        "misc-beat-p1": "I am presenting the release of \"Shadows\", my newest single.",
        "misc-beat-p2": "Unlike the dense compositions and narrative-focused soundtracks I develop for games, this track is a standalone project. It is an original beat, built as an exercise in audio design and rhythmic exploration, completely disconnected from the directional constraints of my games.",
        "misc-beat-p4": "The result reached the quality standard I aim for in my standalone audio projects. Because of that, I decided to catalog the original file and make it publicly available in this archive.",
        "misc-beat-p5": "I hope you enjoy the track.",
        "misc-beat-p6": "If you are interested in rhyming over the beat, feel free to download it and experiment :)",

